"""LGBM Transition Model for Continent Dataset (5-Year Lookahead Prediction)
Train LightGBM on pre-split parquet files. Final model trained on train+earlystop,
using average best_iteration from CV folds (no early stopping), evaluated on test.
Target: transition_01_win5 (1 if transition occurs within next 5 years, else 0)

Features:
- Temporal Cross-Validation: 3 folds with different train/earlystop year splits
- Final Model: Uses average best_iteration from CV folds (no early stopping)
- Time-based Sample Weighting: Later training years get higher weights
  (Year 2000: weight 0.5, Year MAX: weight 1.0, linear interpolation in between)
- Right-Censoring Protection: Earlystop and test data filtered to LAST_LABEL_YEAR
  (LAST_LABEL_YEAR = WDPA_LAST_YEAR - LOOKAHEAD_YEARS) to avoid evaluating on
  labels that don't have complete 5-year lookahead information
"""

